c.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $c=0$ gives an ellipse\n- **II.** $c=-4$ gives a line\n- **III.** $c=5$ gives a hyperbola" #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186373132 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c853fbcf-5be0-5101-8f2a-558cbd4a782f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373132 #edb/ref 1074 "Setting $f(x,y)=c$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-4 & =c \\\\ 3y & =-9x+c+4 \\\\ y & =-3x+\\frac{c+4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- If $c=0$ then the level curve is $y=-3x+\\frac{4}{3},$ which is not an ellipse.\n\n- If $c=-4$ then the level curve is $y=-3x,$ which is a line.\n\n- If $c=5$ then the level curve is $y=-3x+3,$ which is not a hyperbola.\n\nSo, only statement II is true." #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380638 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380639 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380640 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380641 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380642 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186380639 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380637 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "76499bf7-e986-58f6-9967-cfbce16c554a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380638 #edb/ref 1080 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380638 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380638 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4eba5ccd-5c4e-5a36-a064-4ef635ea962c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380639 #edb/ref 1080 "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380639 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380639 #edb/ref 1083 #uui